      "statement": "Specs may optionally declare `logged_metrics: frozenset[str]` (ClassVar, so it stays out of the dataclass knob surface) and `monitor_metric: str | None` (only CheckpointSpec declares it); validate_monitor reads both defensively via getattr.",
