      "id": "claim_fbcc480b93914f2f9c52804d0d3362ed",
      "statement": "The resolved callback name list is rank-symmetric by contract: every DDP rank gets the identical list from torchrun / Lightning spawn, and the registry does not collective-verify that (the ADR-0029 rejected-option note explains the collective guard was rejected as speculative).",
