    {
      "id": "claim_3b6da44903ea4d56b3b13d97b0f8915d",
      "statement": "CallbackRegistry.validate_monitor(specs, module, extra_callbacks=None) checks the checkpoint spec's monitor_metric against the union of (a) every spec's logged_metrics, (b) module.logged_metrics (the Module-declared path: RewardModule declares val/gen_pair_acc / val/pair_acc / val/roc_auc; GRPOModule declares val/mean_reward), and (c) every extra_callbacks member's logged_metrics (the hand-appended path: LatentX0MAE declares val/x0_mae); absence of either a checkpoint spec or monitor_metric=None bypasses validation (the unmonitored periodic / last fallback). A monitor_metric that nobody logs raises ValueError so Lightning does not error mid-fit.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/modules/grpo.py#L316-L316",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1f82da2dbb6da5c00033b6c9470c3af1332a0c0b11421a59f8cf562dd8cd932b:"
