      "id": "claim_496adf4221294237b733b430d8357c25",
      "statement": "Four built-in specs are exported from callbacks/__init__.py: TrainLossSpec (no knobs, logs train/loss_epoch), FIDSpec (num_synth=16, every_n_epochs=1, center_slices_ratio=0.5, cov_ridge=1e-6; logs val/fid), CheckpointSpec (monitor_metric=None, save_top_k=3, save_last=True, every_n_epochs=1, mode='min', filename=None; two-branch build reproduces the prior _build_checkpoint monitored vs unmonitored construction with default filenames unet3d-{epoch:03d}-{step}-{monitor:.3f} or unet3d-{epoch:03d}-{step}), and PairedFidelitySpec (subset_size=8, every_n_epochs=1, num_inference_steps=None recipe-primary, seed=0; logs val/psnr / val/ssim).",
