    {
      "id": "claim_ad5fc8036bff45f0a227e3ecbe9a0eac",
      "statement": "PairedFidelitySpec is exported from callbacks/__init__.py but is only registered by the supervised controlnet_cli shell (its default name list is ['train_loss', 'checkpoint', 'paired_fidelity']); the JiT, GRPO, and reward shells do not register it, so a `--callbacks paired_fidelity` on those paths fails fast with KeyError at resolve. The monitor is observe-only: validate_monitor accepts val/psnr / val/ssim, but the supervised shell keeps the checkpoint on val/x0_mae (LatentX0MAE's metric) so the paired fidelity never enters checkpoint selection.",
