      "id": "claim_fc61ca6a2c9a4612a86a62e722e4f59a",
      "statement": "Per-shell dynamic default callback name lists: JiT (cli.py) builds ['train_loss'] plus optional 'fid' (when enable_fid and val_enabled) plus 'checkpoint'; GRPO (grpo_cli.py) builds ['checkpoint'] plus optional 'fid' (only when the FID triple is present and the policy is not a ControlNet, since the ControlNet path suppresses FID as a constant frozen-base metric); reward (reward_cli.py) builds ['checkpoint']; supervised ControlNet (controlnet_cli.py) builds ['train_loss', 'checkpoint', 'paired_fidelity'].",
