    {
      "id": "claim_cad66ea5d1c649729f1ebfe70350f913",
      "statement": "The ControlNet-GRPO extension of the paired-fidelity monitor remains a deliberate follow-up: extending the monitor to the GRPO path requires releasing forbidden_callbacks={'fid': ...} for this callback specifically (the rationale does not cover a paired rollout that uses controlnet_rollout) and the VAE-on-GPU decode path; until that ADR ships, paired_fidelity is not added to the GRPO default and the val/fid monitor ban is not relaxed for it.",
